      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1909,
      "text": "And [He created] the horses, mules and donkeys for you to ride and for adornment, and He creates other things that you do not know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 268,
      "ruku": 224,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1910,
      "text": "It is upon Allah to show the straight path, while other ways are deviant. If He had willed, He could have guided you all.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 268,
      "ruku": 224,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1911,
      "text": "It is He Who sends down rain from the sky, from it you drink, and by it plants thrive on which you pasture your livestock.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 268,
      "ruku": 225,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1912,
      "text": "He causes to grow therewith crops, olives, palm trees, grapevines and all kinds of fruits[6] for you. Indeed, there is a sign in this for people who reflect.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 268,
      "ruku": 225,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1913,
      "text": "And He has subjected for you the night and day, the sun and moon, and the stars[7] are made subservient by His command. Indeed, there are signs in this for people of understanding.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 268,
      "ruku": 225,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1914,
      "text": "And He has created for you various kinds of things on earth[8]. Indeed, there are signs in this for people who take heed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 268,
      "ruku": 225,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1915,
      "text": "It is He Who has subjected the sea, so that you may eat from it tender meat and extract ornaments to wear. And you see the ships cleaving their way through its waves[9], so that you may seek His bounty and so that you may give thanks.",
